            "review_title": "Review at Highlands Coffee",
            "review_text": "Jasper B\n119 contributions\n0\nBad service, bad products, never again\nJul 2024 • Friends\nThis was the worst place to visit for a coffee so far in Vietnam and we’ve been doing this for ten days now.\nThe service was bad, the order was completely wrong. Instead of 2 combos a banh mi and a smoothie we got a coffee, a smoothie and 1 banh mhi (for three big guys like us) the bread was dry, and bad. We had to leave since we already missed our appoint so payed for 3 items we never got. But the quality was so bad that it was ok. I will never go to this frenchise again\nRead more\nWritten July 29, 2024",
