            "review_text": "Julian Klassen\nDüsseldorf, Germany14 contributions\n0\nShame for service\nAug 2019 • Couples\nWho ever runs this business should teach the staff some manners. \nNo hello, not friendly at all and not even eye contact while I ordered. \nBut the actual problem was that I wasn't asked if I want my coffee to go or I'm a mug having here. Because they saw me going back to my seat, where I placed all my stuff down, i thought its pretty obvious that I will stay. After I got my coffee in a to go cup and asked for a mug they told me NO!\nNo go.\nRead more\nWritten August 11, 2019",
