            "review_text": "NewInNhaTrang\n14 contributions\n0\nGood coffee and atmosphere\nJun 2018 • Couples\nThe coffee here is pretty good and there is a wide choice. The sandwiches are OK too, but nothing special. It's got a semi-Starbucks feel to the place, although more Vietnamese in character, naturally. It's a good place to chill and people watch, if you're sitting outside.\n\nThe have a weird delivery system though, as they give you an electronic gadget that vibrates and flashes when your order is ready. It's also not a very speedy service, so don't be in a hurry.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten June 11, 2018",
