            "review_text": "Candy L\nHong Kong, China418 contributions\n0\nTake a break here!\nDec 2017 • Couples\nThere are 4 Highlands Coffee shops in Nha Trang. I visited the one on the ground floor of Citadines Bayfront Hotel. (The address is 62 Tran Phu, Loc Tho Ward, Nha Trang City, Khanh Hoa.)\n\nThe coffee shop is a good place for sit down and relax. We had 2 drinks and 1 cakes. We ordered the drinks call \"Freeze Ngon\". They are great and cold enough. The price is reasonable. The Chocolate Pearl Cake is very cheap (only VND$29,000). It is tasty and with different layers.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 20, 2018",
